 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-400 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Verified Implementations &amp; Real-World Systems</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight\">Featured Engineering Projects</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg\">Selected works demonstrating automated regression testing, robust backend architectures, and high-performance applications.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-900/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden flex flex-col hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 group hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary/5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px)\"><div class=\"relative h-56 w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800/80\"><img alt=\"Automotive Regression Testing Framework\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-top transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fautomotive-testing.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/